    {
      "params": {
        "note": "Connect the high dv/dt node to the start (short) lead terminal, marked by the top bar, for lowest EMI. In a TPS63020 buck-boost both inductor ends switch (L1 pins 8, 9 and L2 pins 6, 7); which end goes on the start lead is a layout choice.",
        "source": [
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/50632d43-da1b-4cdb-8ab4-3029cab51df3/xfl4020.pdf (745-3 top-view callout)",
          "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps63020.pdf (§5)"
        ],
        "topic": "orientation"
      },
      "type": "usage_note"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "note": "TI recommends a saturation current 20 % above the peak inductor current from its Equation 2. Check the board's peak current against Isat (4.1 A at 10 % drop) and the converter's switch current limit; Coilcraft's Irms values depend on the land pattern, trace size and air flow and should be verified in the application.",
        "source": [
          "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps63020.pdf (§8.2.2.2)",
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/50632d43-da1b-4cdb-8ab4-3029cab51df3/xfl4020.pdf (745-1 note 6)"
        ],
        "topic": "sizing"
      },
      "type": "usage_note"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "note": "Ordering: XFL4020-152MEC is the 7 in machine-ready reel (1000); -152MED the 13 in reel (3500, factory order); B is being replaced by C. Termination T (tin-silver-copper) and S (tin-lead) are special orders. Coilcraft's product page offers XGL4020-152ME_ as a drop-in replacement with lower DCR and higher Isat. LCSC C3033018 is XFL4020-152MEC.",
        "source": [
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/50632d43-da1b-4cdb-8ab4-3029cab51df3/xfl4020.pdf (745-1 note 1)",
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/en-us/products/power/shielded-inductors/molded-inductor/xfl/xfl4020/xfl4020-152/",
          "https://jlcsearch.tscircuit.com/components/list.json?search=XFL4020-152"
        ],
        "topic": "variant"
      },
      "type": "usage_note"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "note": "Max three 40 s reflows at +260 °C with parts cooled to room temperature between cycles; MSL 1. PCB washing tested to MIL-STD-202 Method 215 plus an additional aqueous wash.",
        "source": "https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/50632d43-da1b-4cdb-8ab4-3029cab51df3/xfl4020.pdf (745-1 specifications)",
        "topic": "assembly"
      },
      "type": "usage_note"
    },
    {
      "params": {
        "field": "saturation current and DCR",
        "resolution": "Use the manufacturer's current table. TI's 5.1 A matches no -152 column (it is the -102 value at 20 % drop) and probably comes from an older Coilcraft revision.",
        "sources": [
          "https://www.ti.com/lit/ds/symlink/tps63020.pdf",
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/getmedia/50632d43-da1b-4cdb-8ab4-3029cab51df3/xfl4020.pdf",
          "https://www.coilcraft.com/en-us/products/power/shielded-inductors/molded-inductor/xfl/xfl4020/xfl4020-152/",
          "https://jlcsearch.tscircuit.com/components/list.json?search=XFL4020-152"
        ],
        "values": [
