          "Isat 4.1 / 4.4 / 4.6 A at 10 / 20 / 30 % drop; DCR 14.40 typ / 15.80 max mΩ (Coilcraft Document 745-1 revised 03/10/26; product page; LCSC listing 14.4 mΩ, 4.6 A)"
        ]
      },
      "type": "source_discrepancy"
    },
    {
